  "plain": "Hart Canyon, near Aztec in New Mexico, is a place where some people say a craft crashed in 1948. Podcast host Jesse Michels visited the site, drawing on a man named Carl Flock, and says that somewhere out there in 1948 someone in a hurry mixed concrete, apparently to make a base for a crane. If that is true, it would point to a rushed recovery operation at the spot."
